      "content": "it's hard to move toward anything when the body just won't cooperate. i'm tired of the struggle, honestly. i spend so much time just managing the decline, trying to make things tolerable. it feels like i've already lost everything that made me me, and now i'm just stuck in this shell. i wonder if there's actually any point in fighting it so hard.",
